<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept - traders.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes from Tuesday's paper chains were kept before the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes, due to load in the December 11-13 range were kept by British Petroleum and Phibro, they added.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
